<div id="elementor-tab-content-2022"><p>Landscape project costs in Lakewood vary based on property size, scope, and the mix of lawn, planting, hardscape, and irrigation work involved. A focused front yard redesign with new planting, sod, and edging typically starts around $5,000–$10,000. Full backyard landscape installations with irrigation, hardscape elements, and comprehensive planting generally range from $15,000–$40,000. Larger commercial projects or complete property transformations can exceed $50,000 depending on scale and complexity. We provide detailed, itemised quotes after an in-person site assessment — so you have a clear picture of scope and cost before any commitment is made.</p>
