<div id="elementor-tab-content-2026"><p>Timeline depends on the scope of your project. A front yard refresh — new planting, sod, and edging — can be completed in a few days. A full backyard landscape installation with hardscape, irrigation, and comprehensive planting typically takes 2–4 weeks. Larger or more complex commercial projects take longer. We give you a realistic project schedule before work starts and keep you informed throughout so you always know where the project stands.</p>
